## docs/ holds end-user documentation and nothing else.
##
## Everything that came before it - the design handoffs, the phase plans, the UI
## audits, the original spec - lives on in docs/archive/ on the author's machine.
## It is kept, not deleted: it is the reasoning behind most of the decisions in
## this codebase. It is simply not what someone arriving at the repository needs.
##
## docs/AI planning/ is where working plans are drafted. Same rule: local only.
docs/archive/
